This package uses a solver algorithm with letter-value heuristics to suggest words 
   in a bananagrams game, and includes a library representation of board/word/tile that can be used
   for other tile board games"""
maintainer: ["lgrubb3@jhu.edu" "mnair13@jhu.edu" "tblack20@jhu.edu"]
